// CHEETAH HUNTER v1.0.5 ST7789 Gleec Wallet price-ticker build
// Public/shareable build for ST7789 screen variant
//
// Features:
// - WiFiManager for first-time WiFi setup / recovery
// - local config page after connected
// - edit wallet + screen flip from browser
// - live CHTA wallet balance (10s refresh)
// - cached CHTA USD price from the same Gleec Wallet tickers_v2 feed used by the website
// - optional GBP/CAD values from CoinPaprika for alternate display currencies
// - no manual price multiplier / no made-up adjustment
// - BLOCK FOUND popup on mined tx or confirmed balance increase
//
// Required library:
//   WiFiManager by tzapu / tablatronix

